COMMENT
SP19 BC volume options: a valid VOLEQNUM, MCDEFECT and the merchantability
standards used by the StandStructure deck, on its Fir.15 stand.
END

STDIDENT
BCVolume

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
FVS-BC.Stand.Structure.Data.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'Fir.15'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'Fir.15.3200'
EndSQL
End

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           6
VOLUME                      FD      17.5
VOLUME                      PL      12.5
VOLEQNUM          PL102DVEW108
MCDEFECT                    FD        5.       10.       15.       20.       25.
TREELIST           0

DATABASE
DSNOut
BCVolume.db
Summary
TreeLiDB           2
END

PROCESS
STOP
